## Degraded

- `rch` `degraded`: remote proof routing may be unavailable. Defer heavy validation until rch status is ok or use script-only proof.
- `resource_leases` `defer`: resource lease admission is not fully green. no rch worker has the requested CPU and memory lease available
- `proof_cache` `refresh_required`: proof cache does not report a clean cache hit. all matching proof artifacts require refresh before reuse
- `qos_batches` `all_deferred`: one or more validation requests are deferred or the batch is unavailable. all requests deferred by worker capacity, resource leases, or fairness gates
- `stale_lock_recommendations` `attention`: stalled beads require reopen or contact-first action. Follow the stale-lock recommendation commands before changing assignees.
- `capacity_forecast` `brownout`: predictive capacity forecast is low-confidence or degraded. Defer heavy proof work until the brownout clears.
- `admission_budgets` `defer`: admission budget planning is constrained or deferred. Follow the budget recommendations before admitting more work.
- `lease_exchange_salvage` `manual_confirmation_required`: lease-exchange or salvage promotion requires review. Use the simulation recommendations instead of changing ownership blindly.
- `prefetch_roi` `manual_review_required`: prefetch ROI is degraded, blocked, or not worth taking. Do not warm a fresh target until brownout pressure and cache refresh obligations clear.
- `starvation_rescue_handoff` `manual_review`: starvation rescue handoff still has unresolved risks or manual review pressure. Respect the rescue escalation band and recommended ordering before reopening or reassigning work.
- `checkpoint_restore_handoff` `manual_review`: checkpoint restore handoff still carries fail-closed or manual-review drift. Respect the checkpoint restore escalation band and top restore action before resuming from a saved checkpoint.
- `execution_queue_advisory` `warning`: execution queue advisory is conservative, blocked, or coupled to restore drift. Execution queue runner artifacts are present and risk budget permits advisory queue use.
